OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer admits murdering Ian
OL,4,AHuntley in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA triple killer has admitted murdering
OL,7,FIan Huntley in prison.
OL,9,FAnthony Russell, 44, had initially
OL,10,Fdenied intentionally killing Huntley,
OL,11,F52, at the high security Frankland
OL,12,FPrison, near Durham, in February, but
OL,13,Fadmitted manslaughter.
OL,15,FOn the second day of his trial at
OL,16,FNewcastle Crown Court, Russell, who
OL,17,Fbeat Huntley to death with a metal bar,
OL,18,Fchanged his plea.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
