OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer admits murdering Ian
OL,4,AHuntley in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors previously said it was a
OL,7,F"cold-blooded" and planned attack on
OL,8,FHuntley, who was serving a life
OL,9,Fsentence for murdering two girls in
OL,10,FSoham, Cambridgeshire, in 2002.
